# Organization admin token with `org.serviceAccounts.write`, from
# Settings -> Organization -> Tokens on an Enterprise org.
#
# Deliberately NOT `HF_TOKEN`: that is the researcher/CLI repo token, and an
# inherited shell environment must not be able to drive infrastructure.
HF_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# Optional. Hub base URL; defaults to https://huggingface.co.
# Set this for a self-hosted Enterprise Hub.
# HF_ENDPOINT=
